{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T01:41:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Cache Invalidation Bug Causes Stale Data Usage'. The caching mechanism in the Data Ingestion API isn't invalidating outdated data properly. This is causing slower model adaptation and outdated predictions for CUST-0093. @eid_6a0f49ba, this one's for you. Can you take a look? 🙏", "utterranceID": "20270123-1-cbf06"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270123-1-cbf06"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T01:42:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the caching mechanism and see what's causing the stale data issue. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270123-2-6d572"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270123-2-6d572"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T01:44:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Data Parsing Error Leads to Incomplete Data Ingestion'. The Data Ingestion API is having trouble parsing certain data formats, leading to incomplete data for model optimization. This is affecting CUST-0065. @eid_04a698e5, can you handle this one? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20270123-3-5c113"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270123-3-5c113"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T01:48:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll check the parsing logic and ensure we're handling all data formats correctly. Let's get this sorted for CUST-0065. 💪", "utterranceID": "20270123-4-259a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270123-4-259a7"}
