{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T05:59:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect cache invalidation in the Data Ingestion API has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/AutoTuneForce/pull/54.", "utterranceID": "20270204-0-6e8da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270204-0-6e8da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T06:02:00", "text": "Great news, George! Could you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270204-1-a994d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270204-1-a994d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T06:03:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_04a698e5. The root cause was a logic error in the cache invalidation process. Specifically, the condition to remove outdated data entries was not correctly implemented, which led to the system using stale data.", "utterranceID": "20270204-2-964c4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270204-2-964c4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T06:07:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, George Jones. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270204-3-cc147"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270204-3-cc147"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T06:09:00", "text": "I updated the logic to correctly identify and remove outdated data entries from the cache. This involved adjusting the condition checks to ensure that any data older than the current timestamp is invalidated. Additionally, I added unit tests to cover various scenarios to prevent similar issues in the future.", "utterranceID": "20270204-4-73a6b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270204-4-73a6b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-35b4b2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2027-02-04T06:10:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for taking care of this, George!", "utterranceID": "20270204-5-0c201"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270204-5-0c201"}
