{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:35:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260915-0-1e40f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-0-1e40f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:39:00", "text": "Hey @eid_3f2087c9, I think we should start by addressing the AI misinterpretation issue. We need to enhance the training data section in the document. We should specify the need for diverse datasets to improve AI understanding of user behaviors. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260915-1-ec417"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-1-ec417"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:42:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia. Also, we should add a section on improving the feedback loop for AI models. Continuous learning is crucial for accuracy. Maybe we can include a mechanism for users to provide feedback directly in the UI? 📈", "utterranceID": "20260915-2-b8304"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-2-b8304"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7f69c513", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:44:00", "text": "For the UI issue, I suggest we add a subsection under 'Key Features' focusing on user onboarding and intuitive navigation. We need to simplify the layout and provide better guidance for new users. A walkthrough feature could be beneficial. 🧭", "utterranceID": "20260915-3-630f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-3-630f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:48:00", "text": "Regarding integration inconsistencies, we should emphasize the need for comprehensive testing across third-party applications in the 'Integration' section. Also, let's consider modularizing the integration architecture to adapt to API changes more easily. 🔄", "utterranceID": "20260915-4-e978c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-4-e978c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:52:00", "text": "Good point, Ian. We should also include a note on performance optimization for large datasets. The 'Architecture' section should highlight the need for scalable data processing algorithms and adequate computational resources. ⚙️", "utterranceID": "20260915-5-2362e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-5-2362e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:55:00", "text": "For customization options, let's add a requirement for flexible feature design in the 'Key Features' section. We should ensure the architecture supports adaptability to diverse business needs. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20260915-6-f0333"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-6-f0333"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:56:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! Here's a summary of the key changes: \n1. Enhance training data and feedback loop for AI models.\n2. Simplify UI and improve onboarding.\n3. Emphasize comprehensive testing and modular integration.\n4. Optimize performance for large datasets.\n5. Increase feature customization.\n\nNext steps: I'll update the document with these changes and schedule a follow-up meeting to finalize. Thanks, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260915-7-5ab08"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-7-5ab08"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T06:02:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_extaix_product_requirements_document|Product Requirements Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260917-0-42053"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-0-42053"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T21:35:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270206-0-7d8d7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-0-7d8d7"}
