{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6936f36d", "timestamp": "2026-04-21T09:24:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the issues reported for FForceAIX is limited documentation on integrating with less common third-party APIs. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0048.", "utterranceID": "20260501-0-b55de"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260501-0-b55de"}
