{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e028d1b", "timestamp": "2026-04-22T21:48:00", "text": "@eid_8558304e, that's a good point. We might need to look into enhancing the AI's logic processing capabilities.", "utterranceID": "20260416-6-a0d1c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-6-a0d1c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-04-22T21:51:00", "text": "Also, do we have enough advanced configuration options for handling these complex flows?", "utterranceID": "20260416-7-b352f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-7-b352f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-04-22T21:53:00", "text": "I don't think so. The design might be lacking in that area.", "utterranceID": "20260416-8-f31f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-8-f31f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e028d1b", "timestamp": "2026-04-22T21:58:00", "text": "Let's make sure we document these issues in the planning documents for the next release of FForceAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260416-9-9ad41"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-9-9ad41"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8558304e", "timestamp": "2026-04-22T22:02:00", "text": "Agreed. We should prioritize these fixes to improve the AI's performance.", "utterranceID": "20260416-10-eb402"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-10-eb402"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:01:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for FForceAIX is that some users are experiencing reliability issues with the optimizer crashing during high-load scenarios. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0074.", "utterranceID": "20260607-0-7d1a0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-0-7d1a0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8558304e", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:05:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Alice. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation. Could it be due to insufficient handling of concurrent processes?", "utterranceID": "20260607-1-e850c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-1-e850c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e028d1b", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:07:00", "text": "@eid_8558304e, that's a good point. If the system isn't managing concurrent processes well, it could definitely lead to overloads.", "utterranceID": "20260607-2-ec3de"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-2-ec3de"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:08:00", "text": "Agreed, David. Another angle could be operational. Maybe there wasn't enough stress testing or the load balancing mechanisms are inadequate.", "utterranceID": "20260607-3-c1269"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-3-c1269"}
