{"Channel": {"name": "planning-PersonalizeForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-1c1e2c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-05-23T13:22:00", "text": "I agree with Bob. Also, in the 'Implementation Timeline,' could we add more granularity on the pilot program phases? Detailing specific goals for each phase might help us track progress more effectively.", "utterranceID": "20260523-4-dc6d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260523-4-dc6d4"}
