{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:26:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for shAIX is that some users are having difficulty customizing search parameters to fit their specific business needs. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0032.", "utterranceID": "20261006-0-40d7b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-0-40d7b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_abff6bea", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:30:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, David. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their design choices. Could it be that the user interface has limited options for customization?", "utterranceID": "20261006-1-dc306"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-1-dc306"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_539907c1", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:32:00", "text": "@eid_abff6bea That's a good point, Bob. I also wonder if there's a technical limitation in how search parameters are configured. Maybe the system isn't flexible enough to handle diverse business needs?", "utterranceID": "20261006-2-d18cc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-2-d18cc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:34:00", "text": "Ian, I think you're onto something. If the configuration is too rigid, it could definitely cause issues. We should check the codebase to see how search parameters are currently set up.", "utterranceID": "20261006-3-e8987"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-3-e8987"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:36:00", "text": "Alice, I agree. Also, let's not forget the operational side. Could it be that users aren't fully trained or that the documentation isn't clear enough on how to customize these parameters?", "utterranceID": "20261006-4-888ff"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-4-888ff"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:41:00", "text": "Good point, Julia. We should review the training materials and documentation to ensure they're comprehensive.", "utterranceID": "20261006-5-40425"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-5-40425"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_abff6bea", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:46:00", "text": "So, it sounds like we have a few areas to investigate: design limitations, technical flexibility, and user training/documentation.", "utterranceID": "20261006-6-37ecd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-6-37ecd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_539907c1", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:49:00", "text": "Agreed. Let's make sure we document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of shAIX.", "utterranceID": "20261006-7-c0a1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-7-c0a1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:50:00", "text": "I'll start drafting a report on this so we can track our progress and ensure these issues are addressed.", "utterranceID": "20261006-8-97038"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-8-97038"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:55:00", "text": "Great, thanks Alice. Let's keep the communication open as we work through these.", "utterranceID": "20261006-9-08a20"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-9-08a20"}

