{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T23:44:00", "text": "Yes, David! We should enhance our algorithms to better detect subtle trends. Adding customization options for users to adjust sensitivity could be a game-changer. Also, a section on advanced data preprocessing techniques might help improve accuracy. @eid_36319f22, any input on the operational aspects?", "utterranceID": "20260404-5-932be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-5-932be"}
