{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchFlow", "channelID": "ch-hflow-283c92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_234b3360", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T21:44:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Indexing Delay for High-Volume Channels' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SearchFlow/pull/47.", "utterranceID": "20260902-0-9838e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-0-9838e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchFlow", "channelID": "ch-hflow-283c92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_234b3360", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T21:49:00", "text": "The root cause was that our indexing process wasn't optimized for high-frequency message updates, which led to a backlog in the indexing queue.", "utterranceID": "20260902-1-b87d7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-1-b87d7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchFlow", "channelID": "ch-hflow-283c92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_234b3360", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T21:53:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a dynamic batching mechanism that adjusts the batch size based on the channel's message volume. This ensures that high-traffic channels are indexed more efficiently without overwhelming the system.", "utterranceID": "20260902-2-50028"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-2-50028"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchFlow", "channelID": "ch-hflow-283c92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b98a194c", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T21:54:00", "text": "Great work, Ian! That sounds like a smart solution. Thanks for addressing this so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20260902-3-e2587"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-3-e2587"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchFlow", "channelID": "ch-hflow-283c92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e96d2f38", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T21:57:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_234b3360. This should really improve the search experience for our users in busy channels.", "utterranceID": "20260902-4-14246"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-4-14246"}
