{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SearchFlow", "channelID": "ch-hflow-08262e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_234b3360", "timestamp": "2026-06-12T05:51:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for optimizing deployment times: [Optimize Deployment Times with Parallel Execution](https://github.com/salesforce/SearchFlow/pull/22). I've restructured the pipeline to execute independent tasks in parallel, aiming to reduce deployment time by at least 20%. Let me know your thoughts! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260611-0-b4be5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260611-0-b4be5"}
