{"title": "Expand Training Data for Complex Query Patterns", "summary": "This PR focuses on expanding the training dataset to include more complex query patterns. The goal is to enhance the natural language understanding capabilities of shAIX by incorporating diverse and intricate query examples.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/shAIX/pull/5", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "5", "state": "open", "user": {"login": "eid_4eec2a5a"}, "created_at": "2026-11-05T11:24:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_681e9def"}, "comment": "The new training data looks great and covers a wide range of complex queries. Everything is properly formatted and integrated into the pipeline. Nice work!", "submitted_at": "2026-11-05T13:23:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_12c203a5"}, "comment": "The integration into the training pipeline is seamless, and the unit tests have been updated to reflect these changes. Everything checks out. LGTM, approved!", "submitted_at": "2026-11-05T13:24:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_e5715d9e"}, "comment": "The variety in the new data is impressive, and the thoroughness in updating the unit tests is appreciated. Great job! LGTM, approved!", "submitted_at": "2026-11-05T13:27:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_shAIX_pull_5"}
{"title": "Create Database Table for Session Data Storage", "summary": "Set up a new database table to store session data, indexed by user ID and session timestamp, to facilitate quick retrieval of context information.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/shAIX/pull/6", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "6", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_13786f09"}, "created_at": "2026-11-07T03:20:00", "reviews": [{"state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "user": {"login": "eid_12c203a5"}, "comment": "The table structure looks good, but the migration script needs to include the index creation for the session timestamp to ensure optimal query performance.", "submitted_at": "2026-11-07T13:09:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_b20b58ad"}, "comment": "I agree with the need for indexing the session timestamp for performance. Everything else looks solid.", "submitted_at": "2026-11-07T13:11:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_shAIX_pull_6"}
{"title": "Ensure API Compatibility with Third-Party Applications", "summary": "Update shAIX's API to ensure compatibility with the latest versions of third-party applications. This involves reviewing API endpoints, data formats, and authentication methods.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/shAIX/pull/7", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "7", "state": "open", "user": {"login": "eid_160fca3c"}, "created_at": "2026-11-08T17:45:00", "reviews": [{"state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "user": {"login": "eid_51f0b41f"}, "comment": "Great work on the documentation updates! However, we need to address the AppX issue before moving forward. Once resolved, we can re-run the tests and proceed with merging.", "submitted_at": "2026-11-09T06:32:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_0aa7db32"}, "comment": "Agreed with the need to address the AppX issue. Let us know if you need help with debugging. Looking forward to the updates!", "submitted_at": "2026-11-09T06:33:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_shAIX_pull_7"}

