{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T09:30:00", "text": "Got it, @eid_d96fb219! I'll dive into the database locking issue and see what's causing the slowdown. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260914-2-31445"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-2-31445"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T09:34:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Real-Time Processing Lag' in the Sentiment Analysis Engine. This is causing delays in processing real-time Slack messages, impacting leaders like CUST-0087. @eid_92294e45, can you handle this one?", "utterranceID": "20260914-3-99fbb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-3-99fbb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T09:35:00", "text": "Sure thing, I'll check out the real-time processing lag and work on getting those sentiment reports back up to speed. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260914-4-81809"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-4-81809"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T09:37:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks @eid_92294e45! Lastly, there's a 'Malformed JSON Response Parsing' issue in the API Integration Module. This is leading to dropped messages for users like CUST-0012. @eid_4df5d4b7, can you also take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260914-5-31034"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-5-31034"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T09:40:00", "text": "No problem, I'll tackle the JSON parsing issue too. Let's make sure our data is complete and accurate! 💪", "utterranceID": "20260914-6-70929"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-6-70929"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T09:42:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you need any more details or support. Let's get these issues resolved for our customers! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260914-7-20d25"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-7-20d25"}
