{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T19:51:00", "text": "@eid_0c373165 joined bug-georgegarcia-VizForce. Also, @eid_446bc3ee, @eid_a7dd9c52, @eid_a8040636, @eid_76d9cb07, @eid_13df35ed, @eid_b3fcc490, @eid_df7ae03e joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20261028-1-e5bad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-1-e5bad"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:49:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with VizForce that need our immediate attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261028-0-2179a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-0-2179a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:50:00", "text": "First up, we have a Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerability in the visualization sharing feature. This affects the Security & Authentication Module and poses a risk to users' sensitive data. Impacted customer is CUST-0043. @eid_446bc3ee, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261028-1-20ce3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-1-20ce3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_446bc3ee", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:52:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the XSS issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261028-2-5bae5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-2-5bae5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:57:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, there's an issue with excessive event listener registration in the User Interface & Rendering Layer. This is causing sluggish response times and potential crashes, especially during intensive data manipulation. Impacted customer is CUST-0067. @eid_13df35ed, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261028-3-eb4b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-3-eb4b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:01:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the event listener issue and see what's causing the slowdown. 🏃‍♂️", "utterranceID": "20261028-4-74366"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-4-74366"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:05:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a problem with the AI model misinterpreting null values as zeroes, which is skewing data trends. This affects the Database & Data Management System. Impacted customer is CUST-0086. @eid_13df35ed, can you also take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261028-5-d2f59"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-5-d2f59"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:08:00", "text": "No problem, I'll tackle the AI model issue as well. Let's make sure our visualizations are accurate! 📊", "utterranceID": "20261028-6-9c4ab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-6-9c4ab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:09:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you need any more details or support. Let's get these resolved ASAP for our customers! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261028-7-04d9b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-7-04d9b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_446bc3ee", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:14:00", "text": "Will do! If anyone has insights on recent changes to the Security & Authentication Module, feel free to share. It might help speed things up. 🔐", "utterranceID": "20261028-8-6449c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-8-6449c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:17:00", "text": "Same here, any recent updates on the UI or database systems would be helpful. Let's keep the communication flowing! 🤝", "utterranceID": "20261028-9-80583"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-9-80583"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:21:00", "text": "Absolutely, let's keep each other in the loop. Thanks again, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261028-10-0d5bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-10-0d5bc"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T19:07:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Excessive Event Listener Registration' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/VizForce/pull/57.", "utterranceID": "20261103-0-e9214"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-0-e9214"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T19:08:00", "text": "The root cause was identified as redundant event listeners being attached to UI components without proper cleanup or deduplication. This was causing performance bottlenecks, leading to sluggish response times and increased likelihood of crashes during intensive data manipulation.", "utterranceID": "20261103-1-4f83a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-1-4f83a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T19:11:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a mechanism to ensure that event listeners are properly cleaned up when no longer needed and added a deduplication process to prevent multiple registrations of the same listener. This should significantly improve the application's performance.", "utterranceID": "20261103-2-36a1a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-2-36a1a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_446bc3ee", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T19:15:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_13df35ed! Thanks for tackling this issue. I'll test it out to ensure everything is running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261103-3-888b1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-3-888b1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T19:16:00", "text": "Thanks, George Jones! This should make a big difference in our app's performance. Let me know if you need any help with further testing.", "utterranceID": "20261103-4-6e0a0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-4-6e0a0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-61fdda"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13df35ed", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T19:19:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma and George Garcia! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261103-5-35062"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-5-35062"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T11:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data types in API responses has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/VizForce/pull/62.", "utterranceID": "20261203-0-0080b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261203-0-0080b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ab6f41bc", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T11:32:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_9e9883de! Could you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261203-1-42335"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261203-1-42335"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T11:34:00", "text": "Sure, Fiona Brown. The root cause was improper data type validation during the data serialization process in the API. This led to occasional mismatches, like strings being returned instead of integers.", "utterranceID": "20261203-2-2a282"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261203-2-2a282"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7fba1318", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T11:37:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Hannah. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261203-3-d7c60"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261203-3-d7c60"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T11:38:00", "text": "I added a strict data type validation step during serialization to ensure that all data conforms to the expected types before being sent out. This should prevent any future mismatches.", "utterranceID": "20261203-4-c16e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261203-4-c16e0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ab6f41bc", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T11:42:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for taking care of this so quickly, Hannah!", "utterranceID": "20261203-5-b7002"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261203-5-b7002"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7fba1318", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T11:44:00", "text": "Yes, thanks, @eid_9e9883de! I'll keep an eye on the API responses to ensure everything is working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261203-6-8ddad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261203-6-8ddad"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-12-03T11:47:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! Let me know if you notice any other issues.", "utterranceID": "20261203-7-dcb47"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261203-7-dcb47"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-12-06T01:39:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about inconsistent timestamp formats in our API has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20261205-0-3db6f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261205-0-3db6f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-12-06T01:42:00", "text": "The issue was that timestamps were being delivered in varying formats like ISO 8601 and Unix epoch, which was causing problems with time-series data visualization.", "utterranceID": "20261205-1-db6c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261205-1-db6c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-12-06T01:44:00", "text": "The root cause was a lack of unified timestamp format standardization across different data sources feeding into the API.", "utterranceID": "20261205-2-da6a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261205-2-da6a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-12-06T01:48:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a middleware that converts all incoming timestamps to ISO 8601 format before they are processed by the API. This ensures consistency across all data sources.", "utterranceID": "20261205-3-d3cd9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261205-3-d3cd9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-12-06T01:53:00", "text": "You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/VizForce/pull/63", "utterranceID": "20261205-4-cbdd8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261205-4-cbdd8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ab6f41bc", "timestamp": "2026-12-06T01:54:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_9e9883de! This should make our data visualization much more reliable.", "utterranceID": "20261205-5-4da11"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261205-5-4da11"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67036b20", "timestamp": "2026-12-06T01:58:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! This will definitely help with the analytics dashboard. I'll test it out and let you know if I encounter any issues.", "utterranceID": "20261205-6-aec31"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261205-6-aec31"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e089f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-12-06T01:59:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona and Alice! Let me know if you need any further assistance.", "utterranceID": "20261205-7-66038"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261205-7-66038"}

