{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T16:48:00", "text": "Hey @eid_65324b8a, just started reviewing your PR. The screenshots look promising! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261004-2-51eb9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-2-51eb9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T16:49:00", "text": "I've gone through the changes, and the UI elements are definitely more streamlined. Great job on that front! However, I noticed that the color scheme is consistent, but the typography could use a bit more work to ensure readability across different devices. 📱💻", "utterranceID": "20261004-3-cb605"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-3-cb605"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_65324b8a", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T16:54:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, George Taylor! I'll revisit the typography and make sure it's more readable. Any specific suggestions? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261004-4-362c5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-4-362c5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T16:59:00", "text": "I agree with George Taylor on the typography. Also, I didn't see any documentation on user feedback being collected. Have we conducted any usability tests yet? 🧐", "utterranceID": "20261004-5-644de"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-5-644de"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_65324b8a", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:00:00", "text": "Good catch, George Jones. We haven't conducted usability tests yet, but I plan to schedule them next week. I'll also add a section in the documentation for user feedback. Thanks for pointing that out! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261004-6-b63ea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-6-b63ea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:01:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan, @eid_65324b8a. Once you address these points, I think we'll be in a good spot. Let us know when the updates are ready! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261004-7-b63c5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-7-b63c5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:04:00", "text": "Looking forward to the updates, @eid_65324b8a. Let me know if you need any help with the usability tests. Happy to assist! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261004-8-ed8df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-8-ed8df"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_65324b8a", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:07:00", "text": "Thanks, team! I'll get on these changes and keep you posted. Appreciate the feedback and support! 🙏", "utterranceID": "20261004-9-4d645"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-9-4d645"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:30:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of ATF_AIX. The issue was reported by QA Specialist eid_dc8bf84e.", "utterranceID": "20260705-0-c5811"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-0-c5811"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:33:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. What exactly did they find?", "utterranceID": "20260705-1-21738"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-1-21738"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:38:00", "text": "Some users are having trouble understanding the parameter adjustment process due to a lack of detailed documentation.", "utterranceID": "20260705-2-9e09b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-2-9e09b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:40:00", "text": "Wasn't the product developed and tested by a different team before we took over?", "utterranceID": "20260705-3-9bb58"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-3-9bb58"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:45:00", "text": "Yes, it was. Maybe they didn't provide enough documentation with the product.", "utterranceID": "20260705-4-5901f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-4-5901f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:48:00", "text": "Could be. Also, do we have comprehensive user guides or tutorials available?", "utterranceID": "20260705-5-89894"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-5-89894"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_84b3cc1f", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:52:32", "text": "@here Stay updated with this article on the latest advancements in AI model optimization. It highlights trends that align with the goals of ATF_AIX. https://venturebeat.com/ai/ai-model-optimization-trends/", "utterranceID": "20260617-27-ef5f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260617-27-ef5f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ad0725a2", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:53:00", "text": "Good point, David. If the guides are lacking, that could definitely be a factor.", "utterranceID": "20260705-6-f4f8c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-6-f4f8c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:57:00", "text": "What about the design? Is the parameter adjustment process too complex to explain easily?", "utterranceID": "20260705-7-1aa09"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-7-1aa09"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:58:00", "text": "That's possible. We might need to simplify the process or at least make the explanation clearer.", "utterranceID": "20260705-8-f96b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-8-f96b0"}
