{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T21:23:00", "text": "Great, Alice! Next, there's a React issue titled 'Generic Error Messages in Prop Validation'. Developers are getting non-specific error messages, which makes debugging tough. Here's the PR: https://github.com/facebook/react/pull/1305. This is similar to our 'Misleading Error Messages for Data Validation Failures'. Bob, any thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261128-3-076db"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-3-076db"}
