{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_469598db", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T09:48:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for pAIX is the limited integration options with popular CRM systems. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0114.", "utterranceID": "20260704-0-fa01d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-0-fa01d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T09:53:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Hannah. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation to understand the current integration capabilities.", "utterranceID": "20260704-1-f0a1a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-1-f0a1a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_df39cc9e", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T09:56:00", "text": "Good point, George. I suspect the lack of API support or compatibility with major CRM platforms could be a technical cause.", "utterranceID": "20260704-2-81a1e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-2-81a1e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d9f42fd7", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T09:59:00", "text": "Agreed, Emma. It might also be a design oversight. Maybe there wasn't enough focus on integration features during the product development phase.", "utterranceID": "20260704-3-59cbc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-3-59cbc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4de5cd7f", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:02:00", "text": "That's possible, George. We should also consider operational factors, like insufficient partnerships or collaborations with CRM providers.", "utterranceID": "20260704-4-d4e95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-4-d4e95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_32ff39b2", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:06:00", "text": "I think we should start by reviewing the existing API documentation to see where the gaps are. @eid_469598db, do we have access to that?", "utterranceID": "20260704-5-54fb5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-5-54fb5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_469598db", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:09:00", "text": "Yes, Charlie, we do. I'll share the link to the documentation after this meeting.", "utterranceID": "20260704-6-919e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-6-919e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:14:00", "text": "Great. Once we identify the gaps, we can prioritize which CRM systems to focus on for better integration.", "utterranceID": "20260704-7-18cee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-7-18cee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_df39cc9e", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:18:00", "text": "Let's make sure to document these customer issues in our planning documents for the next release of pAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260704-8-113f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-8-113f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d9f42fd7", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:21:00", "text": "Absolutely, Emma. This will help us ensure that we address these integration issues effectively.", "utterranceID": "20260704-9-b5999"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-9-b5999"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:40:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of pAIX. The report came from QA Specialist eid_7b85a749.", "utterranceID": "20260716-0-fbf67"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-0-fbf67"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_888411ab", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:43:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie. What kind of issues are we looking at?", "utterranceID": "20260716-1-71791"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-1-71791"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:44:00", "text": "Users are experiencing occasional slowdowns during peak usage times, which is affecting performance.", "utterranceID": "20260716-2-6bee1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-2-6bee1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:48:00", "text": "Could it be a technical issue like insufficient server capacity or resource allocation?", "utterranceID": "20260716-3-642a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-3-642a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_50da4819", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:53:00", "text": "That's possible, George. We should check the server logs during those peak times.", "utterranceID": "20260716-4-86d20"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-4-86d20"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:54:00", "text": "Another angle could be operational. Maybe we lack proper load balancing or scaling strategies.", "utterranceID": "20260716-5-614c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-5-614c9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:57:00", "text": "Good point, Julia. We should review our current load balancing setup.", "utterranceID": "20260716-6-88bec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-6-88bec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_888411ab", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T21:58:00", "text": "Also, inefficient backend processes or algorithms might be causing bottlenecks.", "utterranceID": "20260716-7-9e382"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-7-9e382"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T22:02:00", "text": "Agreed, Hannah. We should analyze the backend processes for any inefficiencies.", "utterranceID": "20260716-8-a14ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-8-a14ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_50da4819", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T22:06:00", "text": "Let's document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of pAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260716-9-4a37b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-9-4a37b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-07-11T22:08:00", "text": "Sounds good. We need to ensure these are addressed before the next release.", "utterranceID": "20260716-10-2d57f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-10-2d57f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-07-12T22:17:00", "text": "@eid_e37380e3 joined planning-pAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260712-80-215b3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260712-80-215b3"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:05:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inconsistent Layout Across Mobile Browsers' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/52.", "utterranceID": "20270207-0-f0c07"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-0-f0c07"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:10:00", "text": "That's great news, Ian! Can you explain what was causing the inconsistency?", "utterranceID": "20270207-1-d560b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-1-d560b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:15:00", "text": "Sure, Julia. The root cause was the use of CSS properties that aren't uniformly supported across all mobile browsers. This led to variations in how elements were displayed.", "utterranceID": "20270207-2-b3d0f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-2-b3d0f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7687dbe6", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:19:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270207-3-384d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-3-384d1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:20:00", "text": "I replaced the problematic CSS properties with more universally supported ones and added a few media queries to ensure consistent rendering. This should now provide a uniform layout across all mobile browsers.", "utterranceID": "20270207-4-bb36f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-4-bb36f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:22:00", "text": "Awesome work, @eid_e4d35074! I'll test it on a few devices to confirm everything looks good.", "utterranceID": "20270207-5-040b7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-5-040b7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7687dbe6", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:25:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. Let us know if there's anything else we need to keep an eye on.", "utterranceID": "20270207-6-b09c1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-6-b09c1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:28:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona. I'll keep you posted if anything comes up. Appreciate the support, team!", "utterranceID": "20270207-7-6ffc6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-7-6ffc6"}
