{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T15:24:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_2e1d6568! Lastly, there's an issue with 'Exposed Debug Information in API Responses'. This is a serious security concern as it exposes sensitive data. It's impacting customer CUST-0026. @eid_a041a433, can you also take this one since it's in the API Security & Access Control area?", "utterranceID": "20270219-5-d72cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-5-d72cb"}
