{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:19:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Database Query Bottleneck' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/45.", "utterranceID": "20270107-0-81e1c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-0-81e1c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:22:00", "text": "The root cause was poorly optimized SQL queries that weren't effectively using indexing, which led to slow data retrieval times, especially with large customer profiles.", "utterranceID": "20270107-1-7a99d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-1-7a99d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:24:00", "text": "To fix this, I restructured the SQL queries to make better use of existing indexes and added a few new indexes where necessary. This has significantly improved the query execution time.", "utterranceID": "20270107-2-ce8e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-2-ce8e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:28:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_0deececb! This should really help with the sales pitch generation delays we've been experiencing.", "utterranceID": "20270107-3-f5997"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-3-f5997"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:29:00", "text": "Thanks, George Garcia! I was just about to start on a workaround, but it looks like I won't need to now.", "utterranceID": "20270107-4-f3d78"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-4-f3d78"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_81582c30", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:34:00", "text": "Awesome! Thanks for the quick turnaround, George. I'll test it out with some large profiles and let you know if I encounter any issues.", "utterranceID": "20270107-5-e1a69"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-5-e1a69"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-07T02:39:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you run into any more issues. Happy to help!", "utterranceID": "20270107-6-e6595"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270107-6-e6595"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:10:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Touch Input Lag on Mobile Devices' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/46.", "utterranceID": "20270118-0-ee34c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-0-ee34c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:14:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_e6d2ec9d! Can you explain what was causing the lag?", "utterranceID": "20270118-1-bddb7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-1-bddb7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:18:00", "text": "Sure thing, George. The lag was due to inefficient event handling in our JavaScript code. Specifically, the touch events weren't optimized for mobile performance, which led to delayed response times.", "utterranceID": "20270118-2-7d2db"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-2-7d2db"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:19:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Emma. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270118-3-2b3c1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-3-2b3c1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:24:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I refactored the event handling logic to use passive event listeners. This reduces the delay by allowing the browser to handle touch events more efficiently. Additionally, I optimized the debounce function to ensure smoother interactions with touch elements.", "utterranceID": "20270118-4-918b9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-4-918b9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_81582c30", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:26:00", "text": "Awesome work, Emma! This should really improve the user experience on mobile devices.", "utterranceID": "20270118-5-dd154"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-5-dd154"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:29:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_e6d2ec9d. Thanks for tackling this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20270118-6-c8af9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-6-c8af9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-19T07:33:00", "text": "No problem, George. I'm glad we could get this sorted out. Let me know if you notice any other issues!", "utterranceID": "20270118-7-b620b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-7-b620b"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T11:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect or corrupted data in customer profiles has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/56.", "utterranceID": "20270225-0-972e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-0-972e9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T11:31:00", "text": "The root cause was a synchronization error between the database and the application layer, which was causing data integrity issues.", "utterranceID": "20270225-1-ae6d9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-1-ae6d9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T11:32:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a more robust data validation and synchronization mechanism that ensures consistency between the database and the application layer. This should prevent any future data corruption.", "utterranceID": "20270225-2-13a9b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-2-13a9b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T11:35:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_a041a433! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll test it out to make sure everything is working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20270225-3-2fc5c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-3-2fc5c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T11:37:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! This was a critical issue for our pitch generation. Glad to see it fixed. I'll update the documentation to reflect the changes.", "utterranceID": "20270225-4-a0589"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-4-a0589"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T11:41:00", "text": "Awesome job, Hannah. Let me know if there's anything else you need from the database team to prevent this in the future.", "utterranceID": "20270225-5-b57ec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-5-b57ec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T11:44:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @eid_e4d35074, I'll reach out if I need anything. Let's keep an eye on the logs for any anomalies just in case.", "utterranceID": "20270225-6-999fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-6-999fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:21:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect API rate limiting has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/57.", "utterranceID": "20270228-0-424b6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-0-424b6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:22:00", "text": "That's great news, @eid_2e1d6568! Could you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270228-1-36d59"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-1-36d59"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:23:00", "text": "Sure, Julia. The root cause was an overly aggressive rate limiting configuration on our API gateway. It was set too low, which prevented complete data synchronization from external sources, leading to partial customer profiles.", "utterranceID": "20270228-2-906a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-2-906a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:25:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification, Fiona. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270228-3-32b73"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-3-32b73"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:29:00", "text": "To resolve it, I adjusted the rate limiting settings to a more balanced threshold that accommodates our peak data retrieval needs without overwhelming the system. I also added monitoring to alert us if we approach the new limit.", "utterranceID": "20270228-4-55e3c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-4-55e3c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:30:00", "text": "Nice work, @eid_2e1d6568! That should help prevent similar issues in the future.", "utterranceID": "20270228-5-56b3c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-5-56b3c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:33:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. If anyone notices any further issues or has questions, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20270228-6-7830e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-6-7830e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:37:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. I'll keep an eye on it and let you know if anything comes up.", "utterranceID": "20270228-7-3790a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-7-3790a"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:29:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some feedback from the recent release that we need to address. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260719-0-f5d40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-0-f5d40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:32:00", "text": "Hey @eid_66d09012, I think we should start by addressing the AI-generated pitches issue. The document mentions personalization, but it seems like we're not capturing enough industry-specific nuances. We might need to expand our training data and enhance our NLP capabilities.", "utterranceID": "20260719-1-17a28"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-1-17a28"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:35:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_ee9ca887. From a UX perspective, we should also look at how we're using templates. Over-reliance on generic templates might be part of the problem. Maybe we can add a section on developing more dynamic, context-aware templates?", "utterranceID": "20260719-2-dfe90"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-2-dfe90"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:40:00", "text": "Good point, @eid_59bbe6f6. We should also consider adding a feature for users to provide feedback on pitch quality directly in the UI. This could help the AI learn and adapt more effectively.", "utterranceID": "20260719-3-5e1a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-3-5e1a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71a4de1d", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:45:00", "text": "For the performance issues, it seems like we need to revisit our server capacity and load balancing strategies. The document mentions scalability, but we might need more specific strategies for peak times.", "utterranceID": "20260719-4-5782a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-4-5782a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_32ff39b2", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:46:00", "text": "Yes, @eid_71a4de1d. We should also look into optimizing backend processes. Maybe we can add a section on performance optimization strategies in the document?", "utterranceID": "20260719-5-719f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-5-719f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31ca5b45", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:49:00", "text": "Regarding CRM integration, the document talks about seamless integration, but we need more API support and partnerships. We should expand on this in the 'Future Enhancements' section.", "utterranceID": "20260719-6-65b3b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-6-65b3b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1cfce648", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:53:00", "text": "And for the UI, we need to simplify it for new users. Adding a user-friendly onboarding process or tutorials could help. Let's include this in the 'User Interface' section.", "utterranceID": "20260719-7-5614b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-7-5614b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:58:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! 😊 To summarize, we'll enhance the AI engine with more industry-specific data and NLP capabilities, improve template dynamics, optimize server performance, expand CRM integration, and simplify the UI with better onboarding. I'll update the document with these changes and schedule a follow-up meeting to discuss implementation. Thanks for the input! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260719-8-3e9e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-8-3e9e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-21T20:32:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_paix_product_requirements_document|Product Requirements Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260721-0-6a429"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260721-0-6a429"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-01-31T15:33:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with PitchForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270131-0-7f9aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-0-7f9aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-01-31T15:34:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Data Corruption in Customer Profiles' issue. Customer profiles are showing incorrect data, which affects the pitch generation. This is impacting Customer ID: CUST-0079. The problem lies in the Database Management & Data Synchronization area. @eid_a041a433, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270131-1-3514e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-1-3514e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-01-31T15:37:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the database management and see what's causing the data corruption. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270131-2-e7e8b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-2-e7e8b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-01-31T15:40:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Insufficient Input Sanitization in API Requests' issue. This is a security concern as it could lead to data breaches. It's affecting Customer ID: CUST-0111. @eid_e4d35074, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270131-3-f0c76"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-3-f0c76"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-01-31T15:41:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll prioritize tightening up the API security and ensure proper input sanitization. Thanks for assigning this to me! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270131-4-d8061"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-4-d8061"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-01-31T15:46:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'API Rate Limiting Misconfiguration' issue. It's causing incomplete data retrieval, which affects Customer ID: CUST-0007. This also falls under Database Management & Data Synchronization. @eid_2e1d6568, can you take a look?", "utterranceID": "20270131-5-bca1d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-5-bca1d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-01-31T15:48:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll check the rate limiting settings and make sure we get complete data retrieval. Let's get this sorted! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270131-6-f5994"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-6-f5994"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-01-31T15:49:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to ask questions or share insights as you work through these issues. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270131-7-6e38e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270131-7-6e38e"}
