{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:45:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260930-0-740a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-0-740a7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:46:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Sentiment Analysis Due to Emoji Misinterpretation'. The sentiment analysis engine is misinterpreting certain emojis, like the 'smiling face with smiling eyes', as negative. This affects the Sentiment Analysis Engine and impacts leaders who rely on accurate sentiment reports. Customer ID: CUST-0089. @eid_4df5d4b7, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20260930-1-33b52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-1-33b52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:50:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the emoji interpretation logic and see what's causing the misinterpretation. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260930-2-c30f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-2-c30f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:51:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Inefficient Query Execution Plan' issue. The database management system is generating suboptimal query execution plans, leading to slow response times for sentiment reports. This affects the Database Management System and impacts Customer ID: CUST-0072. @eid_fa6ec727, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260930-3-28eab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-3-28eab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:54:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll optimize the query execution plans to improve performance. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260930-4-ceb34"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-4-ceb34"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:56:00", "text": "Awesome! Lastly, there's a 'Security Vulnerability in User Authentication'. There's a flaw allowing unauthorized access to sentiment analysis reports, which is a big privacy concern. This affects the User Authentication Module and impacts Customer ID: CUST-0105. @eid_fa6ec727, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20260930-5-2031a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-5-2031a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:57:00", "text": "Understood. I'll prioritize fixing this security issue to ensure data privacy. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260930-6-8fbe4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-6-8fbe4"}
