{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-03-07T23:57:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in JupyterLab titled 'Excessive Kernel Suggestions'. The kernel suggestion engine is overwhelming users with too many code completion options, which slows down the notebook interface. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/4837. This seems similar to our 'AI Suggestion Overload' issue. @eid_4d18a84c, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20270307-1-f28c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270307-1-f28c9"}
