{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T07:29:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the API key parsing issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260909-2-7269c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-2-7269c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T07:32:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Mismatched Encryption Protocols'. The AI Connector is having trouble with incompatible encryption protocols, affecting the Authentication Module again. This is impacting Customer CUST-0061. @eid_f12eccf0, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260909-3-e44c7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-3-e44c7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T07:33:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the encryption protocols issue and see what's causing the mismatch. 🔐", "utterranceID": "20260909-4-d2008"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-4-d2008"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T07:37:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'Expired Certificate Handling Error'. The AI Connector isn't handling expired SSL/TLS certificates properly, which is preventing secure connections. This is also in the Authentication Module and is affecting Customer CUST-0050. @eid_f12eccf0, could you handle this one as well?", "utterranceID": "20260909-5-387ef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-5-387ef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T07:38:00", "text": "No problem, I'll take care of the expired certificate issue too. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20260909-6-a657d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-6-a657d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T07:43:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you need any more details or run into any roadblocks. Let's get these resolved for our customers! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260909-7-0ae8a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-7-0ae8a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T07:46:00", "text": "Will do! If anyone has insights on similar API key issues, feel free to share. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260909-8-1ae94"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-8-1ae94"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T07:49:00", "text": "Same here, if anyone has dealt with encryption or certificate handling before, I'd love to hear your thoughts. 💡", "utterranceID": "20260909-9-31455"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-9-31455"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T07:51:00", "text": "Perfect, let's keep the communication open. Thanks again, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260909-10-dd862"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-10-dd862"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-06-19T10:44:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that are similar to the ones we're tackling in Salesforce. Let's take a look and see if we can learn anything from them! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260619-0-d48ea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260619-0-d48ea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-06-19T10:46:00", "text": "First up, we have a bug in Django titled 'Session Token Persistence After Logout'. It seems session tokens remain active even after logout, which could lead to unauthorized access. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/django/django/pull/1426. @eid_2977e519, this sounds a lot like the 'Improper Session Management' issue you're working on.", "utterranceID": "20260619-1-8deb6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260619-1-8deb6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2977e519", "timestamp": "2026-06-19T10:48:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! This is super relevant. I'll review their approach and see if there's anything we can apply to our session management fix. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260619-2-5e3d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260619-2-5e3d4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-06-19T10:49:00", "text": "Next, there's a Node.js issue called 'Thread Pool Saturation Under Load'. It describes how high concurrency requests lead to thread pool saturation, causing delays. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/1427. David, this seems similar to the 'Thread Pool Exhaustion' problem you're handling.", "utterranceID": "20260619-3-758ad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260619-3-758ad"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-06-19T10:52:00", "text": "Great find, Hannah! I'll dive into their solution and see if it can help us optimize our thread pool management. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20260619-4-77397"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260619-4-77397"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-06-19T10:57:00", "text": "Lastly, there's a React issue titled 'Inefficient State Updates Causing UI Lag'. It talks about how frequent state updates in large apps lead to sluggish UI performance. Here's the PR: https://github.com/facebook/react/pull/1428. Bob, this might give us some insights for the 'Inefficient UI State Management' issue.", "utterranceID": "20260619-5-1e5ed"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260619-5-1e5ed"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-06-19T11:00:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! I'll check out their approach to state updates and see if we can incorporate any of their optimizations. 💻", "utterranceID": "20260619-6-002b3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260619-6-002b3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-06-19T11:03:00", "text": "Awesome! Let's keep these references in mind as we work on our fixes. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or want to discuss further. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260619-7-66d46"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260619-7-66d46"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2977e519", "timestamp": "2026-06-19T11:07:00", "text": "Will do! Let's get these issues sorted for our customers. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260619-8-cb282"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260619-8-cb282"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-06-19T11:09:00", "text": "Agreed, let's make it happen! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260619-9-c36d9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260619-9-c36d9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-06-19T11:11:00", "text": "On it! Let's ensure a smooth experience for our users. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260619-10-427a5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260619-10-427a5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-06-22T23:06:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Thread Pool Exhaustion' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ConnectForce/pull/24.", "utterranceID": "20260622-0-a2ed0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260622-0-a2ed0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-06-22T23:11:00", "text": "The root cause was a misconfiguration in the thread pool settings. We had set the maximum number of threads too low, which wasn't sufficient to handle the number of concurrent API requests during peak times.", "utterranceID": "20260622-1-c41e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260622-1-c41e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-06-22T23:14:00", "text": "To fix this, I increased the maximum thread count and adjusted the keep-alive time for idle threads. This should help in efficiently managing the load and prevent the pool from getting exhausted.", "utterranceID": "20260622-2-d6745"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260622-2-d6745"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-06-22T23:16:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_f12eccf0! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll keep an eye on the performance metrics to ensure everything is running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20260622-3-c8c9a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260622-3-c8c9a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2977e519", "timestamp": "2026-06-22T23:18:00", "text": "Thanks, David! This should really help with the response times during our peak hours. I'll update the documentation to reflect the new configuration settings.", "utterranceID": "20260622-4-85913"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260622-4-85913"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-06-22T23:23:00", "text": "Awesome job, David! Let me know if there's anything else you need from the DevOps side to support this change.", "utterranceID": "20260622-5-e574f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260622-5-e574f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-06-22T23:27:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @eid_86205170, @eid_2977e519, and @eid_bb46d667, I appreciate the support. Let's monitor the system closely over the next few days to ensure everything is stable.", "utterranceID": "20260622-6-98d0b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260622-6-98d0b"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T11:40:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the AI Connector failing to establish a secure connection due to expired SSL/TLS certificates.", "utterranceID": "20261013-0-94c13"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-0-94c13"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T11:43:00", "text": "After reviewing the bug titled 'Expired Certificate Handling Error', I've determined that it does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20261013-1-245d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-1-245d8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T11:46:00", "text": "@eid_f12eccf0 Could you explain why it's not a bug? It seemed like a critical issue at first glance.", "utterranceID": "20261013-2-04e2c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-2-04e2c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T11:49:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The issue arises because the authentication module is correctly refusing connections when it encounters expired certificates. This is expected behavior to ensure secure data integration.", "utterranceID": "20261013-3-d15d3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-3-d15d3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T11:52:00", "text": "So, it's more of a configuration issue on the user's end rather than a bug in our system?", "utterranceID": "20261013-4-c7f7f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-4-c7f7f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T11:53:00", "text": "Exactly, Bob. Users need to ensure their certificates are valid and up-to-date. I verified this by testing with both valid and expired certificates, and the system behaved as designed.", "utterranceID": "20261013-5-4ead7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-5-4ead7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86205170", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T11:58:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, David. Should we update any documentation to help users avoid this confusion in the future?", "utterranceID": "20261013-6-7dfbf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-6-7dfbf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f12eccf0", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T12:03:00", "text": "Good idea, Hannah. I'll coordinate with the documentation team to add a note about the importance of maintaining valid certificates.", "utterranceID": "20261013-7-c21c6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-7-c21c6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd582c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bb46d667", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T12:07:00", "text": "Sounds good. Thanks for the update, David!", "utterranceID": "20261013-8-9e56a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-8-9e56a"}
