{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e6a9cc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f95e63d8", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T21:00:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ConnectForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260904-0-f6514"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-0-f6514"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e6a9cc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f95e63d8", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T21:01:00", "text": "First up, we have a report of 'Slow API Response Times'. The API requests are taking too long, impacting real-time data integration for CUST-0019. This is affecting the Backend API. @eid_6dca8945, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260904-1-56dcd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-1-56dcd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e6a9cc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6dca8945", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T21:02:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the Backend API and see what's causing the delays. Thanks for the heads-up, @eid_f95e63d8. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260904-2-ce0eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-2-ce0eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e6a9cc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f95e63d8", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T21:06:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Slow Response on Data Source Selection'. The UI is lagging when users select a data source, which is frustrating for CUST-0030. This is impacting the User Interface. @eid_6dca8945, you're up again!", "utterranceID": "20260904-3-e1e01"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-3-e1e01"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e6a9cc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6dca8945", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T21:09:00", "text": "On it! I'll check the UI performance and see how we can speed things up. Thanks for assigning this to me. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260904-4-24339"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-4-24339"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmiller-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-e6a9cc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f95e63d8", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T21:11:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'Insecure Data Storage in Cache' issue. Sensitive data is at risk for CUST-0019 due to insecure caching in the Network Security area. @eid_6dca8945, can you handle this one too?", "utterranceID": "20260904-5-be6d3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-5-be6d3"}
