{"title": "Add Support for New Sensor Protocols", "summary": "Implement support for additional sensor protocols to enhance device compatibility. This PR focuses on updating the device layer to recognize and process data from newly identified sensor types.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/1", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "1", "state": "open", "user": {"login": "eid_2347b567"}, "created_at": "2026-09-26T08:53:00", "reviews": [{"state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "user": {"login": "eid_4df3bcc2"}, "comment": "The device layer updates look solid and recognize the new protocols well. However, the unit tests don't cover all the new sensor protocols. Please add those tests.", "submitted_at": "2026-09-26T16:15:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_4b38019b"}, "comment": "Great work on the implementation! The documentation needs more detail on the new protocols supported. Please expand on that section.", "submitted_at": "2026-09-26T16:21:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_EF_AIX_pull_1"}
