{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T11:16:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! I'll keep everyone updated on any progress. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260914-9-dcd26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-9-dcd26"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:18:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Security Vulnerability in Lead Data Export' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/60.", "utterranceID": "20261201-0-4e189"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-0-4e189"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:19:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_9f4e2c6f! Can you explain what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261201-1-7f34a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-1-7f34a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:24:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The root cause was that the export module lacked proper encryption protocols for securing data during file generation. This led to sensitive lead information being exposed during the export process.", "utterranceID": "20261201-2-b3825"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-2-b3825"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:29:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261201-3-d5d00"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-3-d5d00"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:32:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I implemented AES-256 encryption for the exported files. This ensures that all sensitive lead data is securely encrypted during the export process. Additionally, I added a verification step to ensure that the encryption is applied correctly before the files are made available for download.", "utterranceID": "20261201-4-6aca5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-4-6aca5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:33:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix, Ian. Thanks for handling this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20261201-5-c2ea5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-5-c2ea5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:35:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_9f4e2c6f. Thanks for the quick turnaround. Let me know if there's anything else you need from us.", "utterranceID": "20261201-6-6d1bf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-6-6d1bf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:36:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_3f4b2681 and Ian. I'll keep you posted if anything else comes up. Appreciate the support!", "utterranceID": "20261201-7-5fc71"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-7-5fc71"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:30:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with LeadForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261213-0-a1ebc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-0-a1ebc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:32:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Insecure Data Transmission in Export Process'. The lead data is being transmitted over unsecured channels during export, which could lead to data breaches. This affects the Data Export Module and impacts customer CUST-0040. @eid_07cc9100, this one's for you. Can you take a look? 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261213-1-9c61e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-1-9c61e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:37:00", "text": "Got it! I'll prioritize this and ensure the data transmission is secured. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261213-2-8bc96"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-2-8bc96"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:40:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Progress Bar Stalls During Import'. The progress bar isn't updating in real-time during lead import, making the system seem unresponsive. This affects the User Interface and impacts customer CUST-0003. @eid_c39dc658, can you handle this one? 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261213-3-bb089"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-3-bb089"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:44:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the UI code and see what's causing the delay. Thanks for assigning this to me! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261213-4-1a913"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-4-1a913"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-14T10:49:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an issue with a 'Modal Dialog Blocks UI Interaction'. A modal dialog is blocking users from accessing other parts of the app during lead import. This also affects the User Interface and impacts customer CUST-0091. @eid_07cc9100, could you also take this one? 🖥️", "utterranceID": "20261213-5-0b1d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261213-5-0b1d4"}
