{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T03:51:00", "text": "I'll keep you all posted on my progress. Thanks for the support, team! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261013-10-4215c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-10-4215c"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T07:23:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about insecure data transmission during the export process.", "utterranceID": "20261226-0-c7896"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-0-c7896"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T07:28:00", "text": "The concern was that lead data is being transmitted over unsecured channels, potentially exposing it to interception.", "utterranceID": "20261226-1-c339a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-1-c339a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T07:32:00", "text": "After reviewing the export module, I found that the transmission is actually occurring over a secure internal network, which is isolated from external access.", "utterranceID": "20261226-2-5bf01"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-2-5bf01"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T07:33:00", "text": "The module does not enforce HTTPS because it's designed to operate within this secure environment, where additional encryption is not necessary.", "utterranceID": "20261226-3-5ccae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-3-5ccae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T07:34:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, George. So, it's functioning as intended within our internal network?", "utterranceID": "20261226-4-4f3db"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-4-4f3db"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T07:38:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_99835861. The data is not exposed to the internet, so the risk of interception is negligible.", "utterranceID": "20261226-5-3b877"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-5-3b877"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T07:41:00", "text": "Good to know. Did you verify the network configuration to ensure it's isolated as expected?", "utterranceID": "20261226-6-fba57"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-6-fba57"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T07:42:00", "text": "Yes, Ian Miller. I checked the network setup and confirmed that the environment is correctly configured to prevent external access.", "utterranceID": "20261226-7-2ce37"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-7-2ce37"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T07:44:00", "text": "Great work, George. It's reassuring to know that our internal processes are secure.", "utterranceID": "20261226-8-fc80c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-8-fc80c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-27T07:49:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone. I'll document this in the bug report and close it as 'No Fix Needed'. Let me know if there are any other concerns.", "utterranceID": "20261226-9-01695"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261226-9-01695"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T17:47:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Progress Bar Stalls During Import' has been resolved. You can check the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/63.", "utterranceID": "20261229-0-c0df0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-0-c0df0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T17:52:00", "text": "The root cause was that the progress bar wasn't linked to the asynchronous import process, which meant it didn't update in real-time and appeared unresponsive to users.", "utterranceID": "20261229-1-6a5e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-1-6a5e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T17:54:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the progress bar to listen for events from the import process. Now, it receives real-time updates and reflects the actual progress accurately.", "utterranceID": "20261229-2-4c99a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-2-4c99a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T17:56:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_c39dc658! This should improve the user experience significantly.", "utterranceID": "20261229-3-82fbc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-3-82fbc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T18:01:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian Miller! I’ll test it out and confirm everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261229-4-1af3a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-4-1af3a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T18:06:00", "text": "Thanks, George and Ian Jones. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20261229-5-ca17e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-5-ca17e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:46:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data types in lead attributes has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/55.", "utterranceID": "20261115-0-814e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-0-814e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:48:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261115-1-292d2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-1-292d2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:51:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_3f4b2681. The root cause was a schema mismatch between the application layer and the database. Some fields were being cast to incorrect types during data insertion, which led to errors in our lead scoring algorithms.", "utterranceID": "20261115-2-c6531"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-2-c6531"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:53:00", "text": "Thanks for the explanation, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261115-3-3c371"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-3-3c371"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:56:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the data insertion logic to ensure that the fields are cast to the correct types. Additionally, I modified the database schema to enforce stricter type constraints, preventing similar issues in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261115-4-2a505"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-4-2a505"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T06:59:00", "text": "Nice work, @eid_c39dc658! This should help improve the accuracy of our lead prioritization.", "utterranceID": "20261115-5-ad831"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-5-ad831"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T07:03:00", "text": "Thanks for the quick turnaround, Ian. Let’s keep an eye on the lead scoring results to ensure everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261115-6-8f847"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-6-8f847"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T07:05:00", "text": "Absolutely, Hannah. I'll monitor the results closely and report any anomalies. Thanks, everyone!", "utterranceID": "20261115-7-59f1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-7-59f1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T15:57:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data import process has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/56.", "utterranceID": "20261117-0-319f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-0-319f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T15:58:00", "text": "The root cause was a mapping error in our data import script. It was assigning external data fields to the wrong database columns, which led to erroneous data entries and flawed lead qualification.", "utterranceID": "20261117-1-40c40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-1-40c40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:02:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the mapping logic in the script to correctly align the external data fields with the appropriate database columns. I also added some unit tests to ensure this doesn't happen again.", "utterranceID": "20261117-2-c1176"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-2-c1176"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:07:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_652e8cd0! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20261117-3-8500a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-3-8500a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:08:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob! This should really help improve the accuracy of our lead data. I'll run some tests on my end to double-check everything.", "utterranceID": "20261117-4-43cee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-4-43cee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:09:00", "text": "Nice job, Bob. Let me know if there's anything else you need from the QA side.", "utterranceID": "20261117-5-a8ab3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-5-a8ab3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:12:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian and Hannah. @eid_99835861, I'll keep you posted if anything comes up during further testing.", "utterranceID": "20261117-6-b741f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-6-b741f"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:46:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect export permissions has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/47.", "utterranceID": "20261003-0-a2f3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-0-a2f3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:48:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261003-1-63e1e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-1-63e1e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:53:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The root cause was a misconfiguration in the export module's permission settings. It was granting users excessive data access rights, allowing them to export more data than they were authorized to access.", "utterranceID": "20261003-2-8c05b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-2-8c05b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:55:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_9f4e2c6f. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261003-3-808cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-3-808cf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:56:00", "text": "I updated the permission settings in the export module to correctly map user roles to their respective data access levels. This ensures that users can only export data they are authorized to access. We also added additional checks to validate permissions before any export action is performed.", "utterranceID": "20261003-4-02377"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-4-02377"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T06:01:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Ian!", "utterranceID": "20261003-5-d94e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-5-d94e9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T06:06:00", "text": "Yes, thanks @eid_9f4e2c6f. I'll make sure to test it thoroughly to ensure everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261003-6-b83f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-6-b83f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T06:09:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20261003-7-ebf31"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-7-ebf31"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:21:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'UI Lag Due to Excessive DOM Updates' has been resolved. You can check out the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/57.", "utterranceID": "20261119-0-79e15"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-0-79e15"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:25:00", "text": "The root cause was inefficient DOM manipulation during the import process, which led to performance bottlenecks and caused the UI to lag.", "utterranceID": "20261119-1-13ba7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-1-13ba7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:26:00", "text": "To fix this, I optimized the DOM updates by batching them together instead of updating the DOM on every single change. This reduces the number of reflows and repaints, significantly improving performance.", "utterranceID": "20261119-2-f4bc0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-2-f4bc0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:29:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_3f4b2681! That should make a big difference for users during the import process.", "utterranceID": "20261119-3-dbfbf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-3-dbfbf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:30:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! This should really help with the user experience. I'll test it out and let you know if I spot anything.", "utterranceID": "20261119-4-12e46"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-4-12e46"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:33:00", "text": "Nice job, Hannah. Batching DOM updates sounds like a smart move. Let me know if you need any help with further testing.", "utterranceID": "20261119-5-69a7e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-5-69a7e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:34:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian and Bob! Please do test it out and let me know if you encounter any issues. Your feedback is always appreciated.", "utterranceID": "20261119-6-e206a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-6-e206a"}
