{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a13234f2", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T15:49:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Market Research Report and update it based on the latest issues reported. 🚀 Here are the main issues we need to address: complex setup process, inconsistent performance with large datasets, limited integration options, non-intuitive UI, and service disruptions during updates. Let's dive in! 💡", "utterranceID": "20260904-0-80878"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-0-80878"}
